        "en": "Clients universally praise head trainer Shannon for her thorough, patient, and compassionate coaching. Reviewers appreciate that she takes time to understand each dog personality, providing practical tools and constructive guidance that instill confidence in first-time puppy raisers and experienced handlers alike."
