      "text": {
        "en": "Dog owners report outstanding success with Shannon structured curriculum, especially her specialized GROWL course for reactive canines. Handlers describe significant reductions in leash pulling, resource guarding, and reactivity toward other dogs, helping pets transition successfully from indoor foundations to outdoor distraction classes."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
