        "en": "Comprehensive video lessons and follow-up"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers highlight Shannon exceptional communication, noting that she provides comprehensive written summaries and video demonstrations after private sessions and group courses. Clients value her prompt responses to training questions outside scheduled lessons, ensuring handlers stay supported throughout their home practice."
      }
