      "q": {
        "en": "What training programs does Zen Dog Canine Training offer?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The school provides a full developmental progression including Puppy Kindergarten, Puppy Grade One and Two, outdoor skills and drills, and private behavioural coaching."
      },
