    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What is the GROWL program designed for?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "GROWL is a specialized course designed for reactive or anxious dogs, focusing on reducing leash reactivity, resource guarding, and environmental stress."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are training resources provided for home practice?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients receive weekly lesson breakdowns, video demonstrations, and email support to guide effective home training routines between sessions."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does Zen Dog offer virtual or in-home coaching?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, Shannon conducts both private in-home coaching sessions and virtual consultations in addition to group classes."
